{"date":"2026-09-26","issue":18,"evidence_status":"verified","articles":[{"slug":"why-clouds-stay-in-the-sky","title":"云里有成吨的水，为什么不会整块掉下来？","status":"verified","core_facts":[{"claim":"典型云滴半径约20微米或更小；平均云滴静止空气终端速度约1.3厘米/秒。","status":"verified","sources":["https://www.weather.gov/source/zhu/ZHU_Training_Page/clouds/cloud_development/clouds.htm"]},{"claim":"云滴在上升气流中可长时间悬浮，长大后通过碰并或冰晶过程形成降水。","status":"verified","sources":["https://www.weather.gov/source/zhu/ZHU_Training_Page/clouds/cloud_development/clouds.htm","https://www.nesdis.noaa.gov/about/k-12-education/atmosphere/what-makes-it-rain","https://weather.metoffice.gov.uk/learn-about/weather/types-of-weather/clouds"]}],"unconfirmed_items":[],"images":[{"original_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cahokia_1.jpg","download_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/Cahokia_1.jpg","http_check":{"method":"GET","validation_path":"web_direct_fetch","final_status":200,"content_type":"image/jpeg","result":"target_image_rendered"},"license_check":{"status":"verified","license":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0)","credit":"Carptrash"}},{"original_url":"https://www.nesdis.noaa.gov/news/cumulus-cloud-rows-over-the-south","download_url":"https://www.nesdis.noaa.gov/s3/migrated/20180215-Gulfc.png","http_check":{"method":"GET","validation_path":"web_direct_fetch","final_status":200,"content_type":"image/png","result":"target_image_rendered"},"license_check":{"status":"verified","license":"Public domain (U.S. Government work, NOAA)","credit":"NOAA NESDIS / Suomi NPP VIIRS"}}]},{"slug":"how-microwave-ovens-heat-food","title":"微波炉真的是从里面往外加热吗？水分子也不是在被“精准共振”","status":"verified","core_facts":[{"claim":"磁控管产生微波；食物吸收微波能并转化为热，微波不会使食物具有放射性。","status":"verified","sources":["https://www.fda.gov/radiation-emitting-products/resources-you-radiation-emitting-products/microwave-ovens"]},{"claim":"厚食物并非从中心向外烹调，内部仍主要依靠较热区域的热传导。","status":"verified","sources":["https://www.fda.gov/radiation-emitting-products/resources-you-radiation-emitting-products/microwave-ovens"]},{"claim":"把2.45 GHz描述为水分子的专属共振频率并不准确，介电加热可涉及多种极性成分。","status":"verified","sources":["https://www.wtamu.edu/~cbaird/sq/mobile/2014/10/15/why-are-the-microwaves-in-a-microwave-oven-tuned-to-water/","https://www.fda.gov/radiation-emitting-products/resources-you-radiation-emitting-products/microwave-ovens"]},{"claim":"Percy Spencer于1945年在雷达磁控管研究中注意到微波加热效应，早期微波炉约6英尺高、超过750磅。","status":"verified","sources":["https://www.si.edu/collections/snapshot/microwave-oven"]}],"unconfirmed_items":[],"images":[{"original_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Microwave_oven_(interior).jpg","download_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/03/Microwave_oven_%28interior%29.jpg?utm_campaign=index&utm_content=original&utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org","http_check":{"method":"GET","validation_path":"web_direct_fetch","final_status":200,"content_type":"image/jpeg","result":"target_image_rendered"},"license_check":{"status":"verified","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","credit":"Mk2010"}},{"original_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Magnetron_detail.jpg","download_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/49/Magnetron_detail.jpg?utm_campaign=index&utm_content=original&utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org","http_check":{"method":"GET","validation_path":"web_direct_fetch","final_status":200,"content_type":"image/jpeg","result":"target_image_rendered"},"license_check":{"status":"verified","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","credit":"Schrauber5"}}]}]}